# M2 directed tests, W2 lockstep against the golden checkpoints, W4
# pass/fail: svnapot runs a 64 KiB NAPOT mapping under Sv39; the FP ones
# cover Zfhmin, Zfa, back-to-back FMA chains and an FP smoke program; cmo
# runs the Zicbom/Zicboz ops with their envcfg and PMP faults; zicond, zcb,
# hint (Zimop, Zihintntl, Zihintpause, Zicbop), sysb (Zawrs, Svinval) and
# supm (pointer masking) cover the remaining scalar extensions.
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
directed/svnapot budget=100000 hex=test/svnapot/svnapot_test.hex
directed/zfhmin budget=100000 hex=test/zfhmin/zfhmin_test.hex
directed/zfa_s1 budget=100000 hex=test/zfa/zfa_s1.hex
directed/zfa_s2 budget=100000 hex=test/zfa/zfa_s2.hex
directed/zfa_s3 budget=100000 hex=test/zfa/zfa_s3.hex
directed/zfa_s4 budget=100000 hex=test/zfa/zfa_s4.hex
directed/fma_ilp budget=100000 hex=test/fma/fma_ilp.hex
directed/fp_smoke budget=200000 hex=test/riscv-arch-test/build/custom/fp_smoke.hex
directed/cmo budget=100000 hex=test/cmo/cmo_test.hex
directed/zicond budget=100000 hex=test/zicond/zicond_test.hex
directed/hint budget=100000 hex=test/hint/hint_test.hex
directed/zcb budget=100000 hex=test/zcb/zcb_test.hex
directed/sysb budget=100000 hex=test/sysb/sysb_test.hex
directed/supm budget=100000 hex=test/supm/supm_test.hex
